      "username": "phantaskippy",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-01-23T04:53:54.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I would disagree to a certain degree with Base Ra being better.</p><p>Horus Ra burns his deck so fast that two turns without that base power can lead to a much better set-up, and a much greater chance of finding his best cards.</p><p>I like Regular Ra better, he feels better when playing him, but I would not at all be surprised that&nbsp;<span>Horus Ra</span><span>&nbsp;wins more games. &nbsp;</span></p>",
