      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/nielzabub/{size}/1986_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-01-23T05:57:46.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It just depends what kind of game you're in. If you're in a fast paced game where damage needs to be dealt from everyone every turn, than base Ra is where it's at, but if you're doing a slow, long game with little ongoing destruction, then Horus Ra is a bit better.</p>",
      "post_number": 6,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:11:46.646Z",
