      "raw": "[quote=\"squad\"]\n\nSo I was a bit surprised by the statistics report, that shows Ra: Horus being about 4% more effective, and getting incapacitated 1% less often when compared to standard Ra. Any ideas on why?&nbsp;\n\n[/quote]\n\nAbout the statistics. Because the data pool is still very low and varied between the two Ras, you should really take those numbers with a grain of salt big enough to choke a donkey.\n\nBeard Ra is going to mill through his deck much quicker than base Ra. This likely means a quicker Imbued Fire. Seeing IF faster on average could certainly have an effect on overall win %. Beard Ra players are also more likely to play into the &quot;Staffarang&quot; style of play contributing to less incaps.\n",
