      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/9de053/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2014-01-23T22:46:46.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>If we knew only that Horus Ra wins more, I would assume it's because he dies and uses his stupidly broken incap power to card-lock the villain forever.&nbsp; But apparently he also dies less often, so that theory's out.</p>",
      "post_number": 11,
