      "created_at": "2014-01-24T04:22:58.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Kismet has a way of suddenly spiking into weird situations. Considering ive lost to base gloomweaver twice in the past 3 weeks (and beat him like 15 times but still) its possible (A combination of 3 zombies, the cultist htat brings out zombies, and pouch of bones meant some really /nasty/ turns for a bit)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>As for the statistics on Ra vs Bearded ra if someone wants me to pull together some formulas let me know. Just be specific in what you want to see, it should be able to pull some of it out. But as Foote said ... take it with a grain of salt big enough to choke a donkey. Such things are fun, but hardly conclusive.</p>",
