      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mariofanaticxv/{size}/2129_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-01-29T01:16:45.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"broccoli\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/broccoli/48/1861_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> broccoli:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>It's also possible that some of those Horus wins were pre Ruling 15. &nbsp;Before that, my whole goal in playing Horus was to get out the super combo, and once you did…games ended quickly unless an Aurora or something similar landed.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>And even without the full combo, Flesh of the Sun God and Imbued Fire made Tachyon and Fanatic so much more useful.</p>\n<p>At least it's still useful for shutting down Plague Rat.</p>",
